*
!.gitignore

# Demo product photos, sourced by `demo:fetch-images` — committed
# deliberately, unlike the rest of this directory. Real uploads (an admin
# adding a product image through the panel) stay excluded; this is
# committed catalogue content the same way database/fixtures/demo/*.json
# is, so a fresh clone + migrate:fresh --seed has working images without
# anyone needing a Pexels API key. 14MB across 182 files as of the run
# that produced them — see docs/how-to/seed-the-database.md, "Product
# images" for the full account.
!demo/
!demo/**
